## Why This Is Asked
Realistic test of building Kubernetes-native cert lifecycle, per-pod scope, scale, and observability.

## Key Concepts
- CRD/controller pattern for per-namespace and per-pod resources
- Secrets management and projected volumes
- In-place secret rotation without pod downtime
- Certificate lifecycles and revocation in-cluster
- Observability: metrics, events, audit logs

## Code Example
